# jackson-core/-databind 2.20.2 inside operaton-webapp-webjar 1.0.3 (demo backend image). The jars
# sit under the webjar's META-INF/resources/webjars/operaton/WEB-INF/lib: static content of a jar
# that is itself in the war's WEB-INF/lib, on no class path, so never loaded. The application's
